B.Wi=new A.ah("feature_missile_barrage","Missile Barrage","[Action] Make a Ranged Attack vs dex, On Success, Distribute {1 + Source} missiles between targets Range 6. Each target takes 1d6 Damage per missile.\n\n[Reaction] When you or an Ally succeed on an Attack during their turn, Spend your reaction and Distribute {1 + Half Source} Missiles between the targets of the triggering attack. Each target takes 1d6 damage per missile.",B.D,B.a3p,!1)
