B.Xh=new A.ah("feature_mortar","Mortar","[Action] During your or an Ally\u2019s Turns, Spend your reaction and Target a free space range 1 and setup and fire your Mortar. Your mortar counts as a Barrier as if made by a skill, and you may spend supply to do anything but make multiple mortars as if it was a barrier. As long as it lasts, You and your allies can spend a [Reaction] to target a 1 space radius range {Source *3} of the mortar, they make a Ranged Attack vs Dex, and on success deal {Source d8} damage.\n\nCover: [Reaction] After an ally range {2*Source} of your Mortar fails on an attack during their turn, Spend your reaction and make a Ranged Attack vs Dex, On Success deal {Source d8} to enemies in a 1 space radius that contains at least 1 space containing a target of the triggering attack.",B.D,B.a3o,!1)
B.Rz=new A.m("feature_mushrooms_Skippers","Skippers","For Enemies, On success Reduce their speed by {Half Source}. For Allies, On Success, Give them {Half Source} additional speed until the start of your turn. You may move your Mushrooms up to {Half Source} Spaces during each of your turns.")
B.Rg=new A.m("feature_mushrooms_Stoners","Stoners","For Enemies, On Success: The enemy is stunned until the end of its turn but may not be stunned by stoners again this encounter. For Allies, On Success, The target has advantage on Int, Wis, and Cha defenses and disadvantage on concentration checks until the start of their next turn.")
