B.X9=new A.ah("feature_ninja","Ninja","Disappear: [Reaction] Start of any turn, Spend your reaction, Dash {Source} spaces to a free space then make a Conceal check to hide.\n\nWithdraw [Reaction] After you or an Ally makes an Attack during their turn, Spend your reaction, Dash {Half Source} Spaces to a free space then make a Conceal check to Hide.\n",B.al,B.a5C,!1)
B.UK=new A.m("feature_ooze_Acidic","Acidic","[Reaction] When damaged by an attack while concentrating on ooze, spend your reaction to Make an Status Check Vs Vit and target absorbed enemies and adjacent enemies. On a Success deal {Source d6} damage. If you fail to concentrate, this effect still occurs.")
