B.VX=new A.ah("feature_pin","Pin","Pin [Action, 2 Unarmed] Make a Melee Attack vs Str targeting an enemy within 1. On Success, deal {Source d6} and you grapple the target and have pinning as long as you remain grappling. While Pinning, enemies adjacent to you grant your allies advantage when making Attacks from outside the grapple against the target rather than disadvantage. If they roll 2 failures they attack you instead. \n\n[Reaction] When an enemy starts its turn adjacent to you or becomes adjacent, Spend your reaction and make a Melee Attack vs Str. On Success, deal {Source d6} damage and grapple the target and gain pinning as long as you remain grappling.",B.D,B.a2U,!1)
