B.Xg=new A.ah("feature_poppet","Poppet","[Action] Make a Melee Attack vs Cha targeting 1 enemy range 1. On Success, deal {Source d8} damage and you make a poppet of the target that lasts as long as you remain concentrating. While concentrating, you and your allies have a +1 to attack results against the target and +1 to defense results caused by the target. The poppet requires a hand to wield.\n\n[Reaction] When you or an ally succeeds with a melee attack during their turn and has a free hand, spend your reaction and create a poppet for 1 of the targets. If an ally is the triggering character, you still concentrate on the poppet even when they are holding it.",B.D,B.a5t,!1)
