B.Wy=new A.ah("feature_rupture","Rupture","[Action] Make a Melee Attack vs Vit targeting an enemy range 1. On Success, give the target {Source} d6 Rupture Bleed. As long as they have Rupture Bleed, before rolling the bleed, if they moved or dashed more than 1 space this turn, increase the dice size of the bleed by 2 to a max of d12. \n\n[Reaction] When you Succeed on an Attack, Spend your reaction and give all the targets of the triggering attack, {Source} d6 Rupture Bleed.",B.D,B.a42,!1)
B.S7=new A.m("feature_sanctuary_Sleepy","Sleepy","When allies gain rest, If they are prone or choose to drop prone, they gain both benefits. When an ally in the sanctuary benefits from the extra healing or shield, they may drop prone to gain {Source d6} extra instead.")
