B.VJ=new A.ah("feature_sanctuary","Sanctuary","Sanctuary [Action] Create a sanctuary that is a {Source} radius area containing at least 1 of your spaces for as long as you remain concentrating. While concentrating, when an ally in the sanctuary is healed or given shield by an ability other than this ability, they gain {Half Source d6} extra healing or shield. If an effect grants both, they choose either a bonus to healing or shield. Healing from regenerating in the area also gains this bonus healing. If an ability has multiple healing or shielding effects, only grant the bonus once per target.\n\nRest [Reaction] During your or ally turns, Spend your reaction and make a Status Check. On Success you and all your allies in the Sanctuary may either Heal {Half Source d6} or gain {Half Source d6} shield, decided by each character. If they do not have an enemy adjacent to them, they gain {Source d6} instead.\n",B.al,B.a4V,!1)
