B.QH=new A.m("feature_snuff_out_murderous_glee","Murderous Glee","Whenever you kill a target with snuff out, gain {Source d12} shield, and dash to a free space within {Source}. Until the end of your next turn or for as long as you concentrate, you and your allies have advantage on attacks against targets within {Source} spaces of you.")
