B.Hb=new A.cH("elemental","Elemental","Every encounter gain {Level} elemental Charges. Pick a defense type and elemental effect when you pick this. When you or an ally range {Half Level} makes or succeeds an Attack vs that defense, you may spend 1 charge to apply your elemental effect. When you fail a defense of that type, you may spend 1 charge to gain resistance to the damage.",0,!0,B.a3R)
B.H8=new A.cH("merchant","Merchant","You gain extra {Half Level} supply. You can use healing items on allies as a [Reaction] during ally turns.",0,!1,null)
B.H9=new A.cH("lucky","Lucky","You start each encounter with {Level / 3} luck rerolls. When you roll the max result of a success check, gain a luck reroll. You may have up to {Half Level} rerolls at one time and you may use only 1 reroll per check. You lose all rerolls at the end of the encounter.",0,!1,null)
B.Hc=new A.cH("thruster","Thruster","Gain {level/3} speed. [Reaction], When you would be targeted by an ability, you may immediately dash {Level}, then recheck if you may still be targeted.",0,!1,null)
B.Ha=new A.cH("undead","Undead","When you die, you instead don\u2019t and set your health to Half and gain {Half Level d6} Shield. You may do this {Level / 3} times per body.",0,!1,null)
B.H6=new A.cH("creator","Creator","At the start of Combat and the end of each round, you or an ally gains {Half Level d8} shield.",0,!1,null)
B.H7=new A.cH("spectral","Spectral","Your attacks ignore resistance and you gain resistance to all damage, and half all {} calculations from your abilities other than this one. You ignore difficult terrain and lose 1 speed. Creatures may occupy your spaces and your spaces count as free spaces for abilities. You may move through enemies' spaces, and enemies may move through you. When you end your turn in another creature's space, or When a creature ends their turn in your space, you lose {Half level d6} health and the other creature either takes twice that as damage or gains twice that as shield, your choice. ",0,!1,null)
B.H5=new A.cH("swarm","Swarm","Increase your size by 1. You cannot be flanked and don\u2019t benefit from flanking. You automatically succeed checks to escape grapple. Creatures may occupy your spaces and your spaces count as free spaces for abilities. You may move through enemies' spaces, and enemies may move through you. At the end of your turn, choose either, to deal {Half Level d6} damage to enemies in your spaces or heal allies in your spaces {half level d6}, or give allies in your spaces {Half Level d6} shield. Pick when you pick this. \n        If two or more swarms overlap, at the end of any creature's turn who is inside of the overlap including the swarms, they must succeed a Str defense or take {Level d6} Bludgeoning damage.",0,!1,null)
