B.ar5=new A.bw("weapon_ranged_crossbow","Crossbow",B.aS,"You have advantage on attacks within the short range when targeting non adjacent enemies. Deal {Half Source d6} extra damage when firing over a barrier. You must Ready your crossbow to use it again by spending an action or reaction during your turn. Your crossbow starts ready unless jumped or surprised.","5 / 10","{Source d8}","{Source d10}","Dex")
